{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fast-retailing-philosophy","title":"迅销集团经营理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/fast-retailing-philosophy","wordCount":2097,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"store-manager-centric","title":"店长是最重要的经营者","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/store-manager-centric","wordCount":2028,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"all-hands-management","title":"全员经营理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/all-hands-management","wordCount":2176,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"优衣库使命愿景价值观体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":2153,"readingTime":9},{"seq":5,"slug":"yanai-tadashi-leadership","title":"柳井正的经营哲学与领导力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/yanai-tadashi-leadership","wordCount":2351,"readingTime":10},{"seq":6,"slug":"lifewear-philosophy-deep","title":"LifeWear 哲学深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/lifewear-philosophy-deep","wordCount":2266,"readingTime":10},{"seq":7,"slug":"global-ambition","title":"优衣库全球化战略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/uniqlo/culture-and-values/global-ambition","wordCount":2366,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文化与价值观-简介\">文化与价值观 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦优衣库企业文化的根基——迅销集团的经营理念体系及其在组织中的贯彻方式。</p>\n<p><strong>迅销集团经营理念</strong>系统梳理柳井正创立的「二十三条经营理念」，解析「改变服装、改变常识、改变世界」的企业使命如何从口号转化为日常经营行为，以及迅销集团如何通过理念体系实现全球数万员工的价值观统一。</p>\n<p><strong>店长是最重要的经营者</strong>阐述优衣库最具特色的管理原则。在这一体系中，店长不是简单的执行者，而是拥有完整经营责任的「独立商人」，这一定位如何重塑了零售业的组织结构与人才培养模式。</p>\n<p><strong>全员经营理念</strong>探讨优衣库如何将经营意识从管理层延伸到每一位员工，通过制度设计和文化塑造让基层员工具备主人翁意识，形成「人人都是经营者」的组织氛围。</p>\n<p>建议按顺序阅读，从集团理念到店长定位再到全员贯彻，理解优衣库文化体系的层层递进逻辑。</p>\n"}